   r &= \frac{4}{3}(12) = 16
   \end{align*}

6. We can use this value to find the y-coordinate $s$ of point $T(r,s)$:
   \begin{align*}
   s &= -\frac{3}{4}r + 9 \\
   s &= -\frac{3}{4}(16) + 9 = -12 + 9 = -3
   \end{align*}

7. Finally, we can find the value of $r+s$:
