\begin{align*}
\frac{123123}{1001} &= \frac{\left(\frac{121}{11} \times 1001 + 22\right)}{1001}\\
&= \frac{121 \times 11}{1001} + \frac{22}{1001}\\
&= \frac{1331}{1001} + \frac{22}{1001}\\
&= \boxed{\frac{1353}{1001}}
\end{align*}

So, the value of $123123$ divided by $1001$ is $\boxed{\frac{1353}{1001}}$.

