-\frac{3}{26}+\frac{50}{26}+\frac{12}{26} \\
0+0+3 
\end{pmatrix}\\
&=\boxed{\begin{pmatrix}
\frac{47}{26}\\ \frac{59}{26}\\ 3
\end{pmatrix}}
\end{align*}

The final answer is: $\boxed{\begin{pmatrix}\frac{47}{26}\\\frac{59}{26}\\3\end{pmatrix}}$

