& = (2 \cdot 3)^2 + 2(2 \cdot 3)(5) + (5)^2 \\
& = (6)^2 + 2(6)(5) + (5)^2 \\
& = 36 + 60 + 25
\end{align*}

\begin{align*}
\text{Now, we simplify the expression by adding the numbers together:}\\
