## Step 2
Multiplying $\frac{2+2i}{-3+4i}$ by $\frac{-3-4i}{-3-4i}$ gives us \begin{align*}
\frac{(2+2i)(-3-4i)}{(-3+4i)(-3-4i)}
&=
